From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:01:55 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: plain PlaitOS page, home-tile icons on every page

The PlaitOS page was a TabLayout + ViewPager2 of the four groups; on
Android 17 the TabLayout can't resolve its Material color attributes
in Settings' theme and the page crashed on open. It is now a plain
DashboardFragment listing the four group pages.

Row icons on every page now take the look of Android 17's home tiles
(system icon shape, light background, dark symbol in the same hue, at
the tile's 40dp/24dp sizes, symbol centered). The home page's own
expressive tiles are left as stock draws them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WNZzm3ssZ7eH5QDg4P9AiP
